---
description: Astro Extension Kit conventions
globs: ["src/**"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read AGENTS.md first. Astro 7 + Tailwind 4, static, zero framework JS.
- Use design-token utilities (bg-paper, text-ink, text-ink-2, border-line, bg-signal, text-signal-ink, text-ok); never raw hex in components.
- Every UI string goes in src/i18n/ui.ts for en, ja, zh-TW.
- Pages live in src/pages/[...lang]/ and export `getStaticPaths = langPaths`.
- Run `npx astro check` and `npm run build` before finishing.
